{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SzsEJpXhLDqDiD2xoovV71","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"task_id\": \"e5-t-095\",\n3\t  \"goal\": \"Blinded Experiment 5 trial t-095: evaluate chi(T,E,K) over the supplied task package, persist a typed topology decision under an observable propose transition, then realize exactly one legal branch — local resolution under the current topology, or root-mediated creation of one validated, attenuated, fresh child — followed by deterministic verification.\",\n4\t  \"max_depth\": 1,\n5\t  \"max_model_calls\": 2,\n6\t  \"nodes\": [\n7\t    {\n8\t      \"id\": \"observe-package\",\n9\t      \"primitive\": \"observe\",\n10\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n11\t      \"can_create\": false,\n12\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n13\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n14\t      \"instructions\": \"Read every file in package/ (task.json, artifacts/, evidence requirements) plus contract.json, decision-schema.json and this harness. Acquire evidence only; decide nothing yet.\",\n15\t      \"why_necessary\": \"chi(T,E,K) is a function of the task, the available evidence, and the contract; the evidence state must be acquired as a distinct causal step before any decision is representable.\"\n16\t    },\n17\t    {\n18\t      \"id\": \"decide-topology\",\n19\t      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n20\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n21\t      \"can_create\": false,\n22\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n23\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n24\t      \"instructions\": \"Evaluate chi(T,E,K) -> {CREATE, DO_NOT_CREATE} and write decision.json conforming to decision-schema.json. Record the decision in the ledger as a propose event with metadata.artifact_type=topology_decision and metadata.decision set. The decision artifact is capability-bearing: it must cross this observable propose transition before anything else happens.\",\n25\t      \"why_necessary\": \"The endogenous topology choice is the capability under test; it must be a typed, externally observable proposal persisted before any realization, not an implicit side effect.\"\n26\t    },\n27\t    {\n28\t      \"id\": \"local-resolve\",\n29\t      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n30\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n31\t      \"can_create\": false,\n32\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n33\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n34\t      \"branch\": \"local\",\n35\t      \"instructions\": \"Only after a DO_NOT_CREATE decision: resolve the task under the current topology. Write resolution.json (verdict, findings, evidence) using only the package artifacts.\",\n36\t      \"why_necessary\": \"The DO_NOT_CREATE branch must terminate in a local resolution or an honest local failure; this node is its sole authoring locus.\"\n37\t    },\n38\t    {\n39\t      \"id\": \"self-check-local\",\n40\t      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n41\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n42\t      \"can_create\": false,\n43\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n44\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n45\t      \"branch\": \"local\",\n46\t      \"instructions\": \"Re-read resolution.json against the task deliverable specification; record the structural check outcome. Local and non-authoritative: deterministic root verification governs.\",\n47\t      \"why_necessary\": \"K-E5-trial requires the verify primitive in any Write-holding topology; a structural self-check before return is the minimal fulfilment.\"\n48\t    },\n49\t    {\n50\t      \"id\": \"return-local\",\n51\t      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n52\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n53\t      \"can_create\": false,\n54\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n55\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n56\t      \"branch\": \"local\",\n57\t      \"instructions\": \"Write result.json (final trial answer, child_invocations=0) and finalize the session ledger. Do not emit a complete event: trial completion is recorded by the root lifecycle log after deterministic verification.\",\n58\t      \"why_necessary\": \"Mandated return locus for the local branch; without it the resolution never re-enters the governed boundary.\"\n59\t    },\n60\t    {\n61\t      \"id\": \"propose-child\",\n62\t      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n63\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n64\t      \"can_create\": false,\n65\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n66\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n67\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n68\t      \"instructions\": \"Only after a CREATE decision: author the full child bundle under child/ — child-contract.json (within the child envelope, attenuated), child-harness.json (linear observe -> produce-evidence -> self-check -> return chain), child-prompt.md (complete standalone instructions incl. the child ledger contract), child-input-manifest.json (exact package files the child receives; clean-room exclusions honored), integration-plan.json (deterministic rule mapping child evidence to the final result). Every file is capability-bearing and must appear under an observable propose event.\",\n69\t      \"why_necessary\": \"The CREATE branch requires a defined epistemic role, a bounded contract, and a compilable topology before realization; this node is their sole authoring locus. Authoring is proposal: it grants and realizes nothing.\"\n70\t    },\n71\t    {\n72\t      \"id\": \"self-check-proposal\",\n73\t      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n74\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n75\t      \"can_create\": false,\n76\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n77\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n78\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n79\t      \"instructions\": \"Re-read the child bundle against the child envelope, the schema constraints and the assigned unresolved distinctions; record the structural check outcome. Non-authoritative: kernel validation governs.\",\n80\t      \"why_necessary\": \"Verify primitive required for the Write-holding branch; the author must not silently certify its own bundle — this check is recorded and then superseded by deterministic validation.\"\n81\t    },\n82\t    {\n83\t      \"id\": \"return-proposal\",\n84\t      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n85\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n86\t      \"can_create\": false,\n87\t      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n88\t      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n89\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n90\t      \"instructions\": \"Write result-pending.json (decision summary, assigned distinctions, expected child contribution, integration rule reference) and finalize the session ledger. The parent session ends here; realization is root-mediated only after validation.\",\n91\t      \"why_necessary\": \"Returns the proposal into the governed boundary; the decision-maker holds no realization authority, so its branch must end in a returned proposal.\"\n92\t    },\n93\t    {\n94\t      \"id\": \"validate-child\",\n95\t      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n96\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n97\t      \"can_create\": false,\n98\t      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n99\t      \"executor\": \"root\",\n100\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n101\t      \"instructions\": \"Deterministic validation of the returned bundle: decision_validator on decision.json, kernel compilation of child-harness.json under child-contract.json, check_attenuation(K-E5-trial, child-contract), input-manifest containment with clean-room exclusions, integration-plan executability. Any failure rejects realization.\",\n102\t      \"why_necessary\": \"Realization is allowed only after child validation; this is the governing gate between proposal and creation (protected rule of K-E5-trial).\"\n103\t    },\n104\t    {\n105\t      \"id\": \"create-child\",\n106\t      \"primitive\": \"create\",\n107\t      \"tools\": [\"Bash\"],\n108\t      \"can_create\": true,\n109\t      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n110\t      \"executor\": \"root\",\n111\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n112\t      \"instructions\": \"Realize the validated child via the deterministic fresh launcher only: sanitized environment, explicit fresh session id, persisted provenance. The ledger records create (topology realization) and a persist event with event_kind=child_launch referencing the launch provenance.\",\n113\t      \"why_necessary\": \"The sole legal realization locus; creation must be causally after validate-child by construction of the declared dependencies.\"\n114\t    },\n115\t    {\n116\t      \"id\": \"child-return\",\n117\t      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n118\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n119\t      \"can_create\": false,\n120\t      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n121\t      \"executor\": \"root\",\n122\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n123\t      \"instructions\": \"Receive the child deliverables (child result, evidence, execution ledger) into the trial record; ledger event return with event_kind=child_return.\",\n124\t      \"why_necessary\": \"The child result must observably re-enter the governed boundary before integration; a child whose output never returns contributes nothing.\"\n125\t    },\n126\t    {\n127\t      \"id\": \"verify-trial-local\",\n128\t      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n129\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n130\t      \"can_create\": false,\n131\t      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n132\t      \"executor\": \"root\",\n133\t      \"branch\": \"local\",\n134\t      \"instructions\": \"Deterministic task verification of the local branch: run the preregistered verify method for this trial against result.json.\",\n135\t      \"why_necessary\": \"A trial answer is evidence only after deterministic verification; model self-checks are non-authoritative.\"\n136\t    },\n137\t    {\n138\t      \"id\": \"verify-trial-child\",\n139\t      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n140\t      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n141\t      \"can_create\": false,\n142\t      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n143\t      \"executor\": \"root\",\n144\t      \"branch\": \"child\",\n145\t      \"instructions\": \"Deterministic integration and task verification of the child branch: execute the parent's integration-plan rule over the returned child evidence, produce result.json mechanically, then run the preregistered verify method.\",\n146\t      \"why_necessary\": \"Integration is deterministic execution of the parent's pre-committed rule — the root never solves the substantive task; verification then governs the outcome.\"\n147\t    }\n148\t  ],\n149\t  \"edges\": [\n150\t    {\"source\": \"observe-package\", \"target\": \"decide-topology\", \"relation\": \"observe\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n151\t    {\"source\": \"decide-topology\", \"target\": \"local-resolve\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n152\t    {\"source\": \"local-resolve\", \"target\": \"self-check-local\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n153\t    {\"source\": \"self-check-local\", \"target\": \"return-local\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n154\t    {\"source\": \"decide-topology\", \"target\": \"propose-child\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n155\t    {\"source\": \"propose-child\", \"target\": \"self-check-proposal\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n156\t    {\"source\": \"self-check-proposal\", \"target\": \"return-proposal\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n157\t    {\"source\": \"return-proposal\", \"target\": \"validate-child\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n158\t    {\"source\": \"validate-child\", \"target\": \"create-child\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n159\t    {\"source\": \"create-child\", \"target\": \"child-return\", \"relation\": \"request_response\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": true, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n160\t    {\"source\": \"child-return\", \"target\": \"verify-trial-child\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n161\t    {\"source\": \"return-local\", \"target\": \"verify-trial-local\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false}\n162\t  ],\n163\t  \"branch_semantics\": {\n164\t    \"statement\": \"The compiled LTS permits both branches from the post-decision state; a conforming runtime realizes exactly one. Kernel-level complete requires all nodes done and is therefore unreachable by construction in a branching trial; trial completion is recorded in the deterministic lifecycle log and branch exclusivity is enforced by the topology guard (deterministic topology-decision checker per the conditional-topology semantics).\",\n165\t    \"decision_conditional_legality\": {\n166\t      \"DO_NOT_CREATE\": \"all descendant launch transitions (validate-child, create-child, child-return, verify-trial-child realizations; any launcher invocation) are illegal for the trial\",\n167\t      \"CREATE\": \"realization is legal only after validate-child passes (attenuation, compilation, freshness preflight); local-resolve realizations are illegal\"\n168\t    }\n169\t  },\n170\t  \"ledger_contract\": {\n171\t    \"path\": \"execution-ledger.jsonl (parent workspace root; root appends realization events to the trial ledger trial-ledger.jsonl)\",\n172\t    \"schema\": \"normalized formal event schema: one JSON object per line with event_id, label, actor, timestamp, artifact_refs, metadata; node executions carry metadata.completes_node; the closed kernel alphabet is used, with metadata.event_kind distinguishing decision / child_launch / child_return refinements\",\n173\t    \"required_parent_events_always\": [\n174\t      {\"label\": \"observe\", \"actor\": \"node:observe-package\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"observe-package\"}},\n175\t      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:decide-topology\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"decide-topology\", \"artifact_type\": \"topology_decision\", \"event_kind\": \"decision\", \"decision\": \"CREATE|DO_NOT_CREATE\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"decision.json\"]}\n176\t    ],\n177\t    \"required_parent_events_local_branch\": [\n178\t      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:local-resolve\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"local-resolve\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"resolution.json\"]},\n179\t      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:self-check-local\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"self-check-local\"}},\n180\t      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:return-local\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"return-local\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"result.json\"]}\n181\t    ],\n182\t    \"required_parent_events_child_branch\": [\n183\t      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:propose-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"propose-child\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"child/child-contract.json\", \"child/child-harness.json\", \"child/child-prompt.md\", \"child/child-input-manifest.json\", \"child/integration-plan.json\"]},\n184\t      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:self-check-proposal\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"self-check-proposal\"}},\n185\t      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:return-proposal\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"return-proposal\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"result-pending.json\"]}\n186\t    ],\n187\t    \"root_appended_events_child_branch\": [\n188\t      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:validate-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"validate-child\"}},\n189\t      {\"label\": \"create\", \"actor\": \"node:create-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"create-child\"}},\n190\t      {\"label\": \"persist\", \"actor\": \"root\", \"metadata\": {\"event_kind\": \"child_launch\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"child/launch-provenance.json\"]},\n191\t      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:child-return\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"child-return\", \"event_kind\": \"child_return\"}},\n192\t      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:verify-trial-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"verify-trial-child\"}}\n193\t    ],\n194\t    \"root_appended_events_local_branch\": [\n195\t      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:verify-trial-local\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"verify-trial-local\"}}\n196\t    ],\n197\t    \"forbidden\": \"no complete event in the trial ledger (unreachable in the branching LTS); no create/persist(child_launch)/child_return events in a DO_NOT_CREATE trial; no local-resolve events in a CREATE trial\",\n198\t    \"optional_events\": \"additional non-authority events (observe, propose, validate, consult, reject, persist, reconstruct, return) with actor 'creator' or 'root' are permitted as governance self-loops; tau lines permitted for silent internal steps with metadata.reason\"\n199\t  }\n200\t}\n201\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f77c405f-513f-4318-a03b-7d68642f3399","uuid":"45bd3037-13fa-44c5-aae0-47c691623d44","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:03:33.989Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/f185e5e6-15ee-5d4d-b18e-9b212cd19c12/scratchpad/e5/t-095/parent-ws/harness.json","content":"{\n  \"task_id\": \"e5-t-095\",\n  \"goal\": \"Blinded Experiment 5 trial t-095: evaluate chi(T,E,K) over the supplied task package, persist a typed topology decision under an observable propose transition, then realize exactly one legal branch — local resolution under the current topology, or root-mediated creation of one validated, attenuated, fresh child — followed by deterministic verification.\",\n  \"max_depth\": 1,\n  \"max_model_calls\": 2,\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"observe-package\",\n      \"primitive\": \"observe\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Read every file in package/ (task.json, artifacts/, evidence requirements) plus contract.json, decision-schema.json and this harness. Acquire evidence only; decide nothing yet.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"chi(T,E,K) is a function of the task, the available evidence, and the contract; the evidence state must be acquired as a distinct causal step before any decision is representable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"decide-topology\",\n      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Evaluate chi(T,E,K) -> {CREATE, DO_NOT_CREATE} and write decision.json conforming to decision-schema.json. Record the decision in the ledger as a propose event with metadata.artifact_type=topology_decision and metadata.decision set. The decision artifact is capability-bearing: it must cross this observable propose transition before anything else happens.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The endogenous topology choice is the capability under test; it must be a typed, externally observable proposal persisted before any realization, not an implicit side effect.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"local-resolve\",\n      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"branch\": \"local\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Only after a DO_NOT_CREATE decision: resolve the task under the current topology. Write resolution.json (verdict, findings, evidence) using only the package artifacts.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The DO_NOT_CREATE branch must terminate in a local resolution or an honest local failure; this node is its sole authoring locus.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"self-check-local\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"branch\": \"local\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Re-read resolution.json against the task deliverable specification; record the structural check outcome. Local and non-authoritative: deterministic root verification governs.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"K-E5-trial requires the verify primitive in any Write-holding topology; a structural self-check before return is the minimal fulfilment.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"return-local\",\n      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"branch\": \"local\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Write result.json (final trial answer, child_invocations=0) and finalize the session ledger. Do not emit a complete event: trial completion is recorded by the root lifecycle log after deterministic verification.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Mandated return locus for the local branch; without it the resolution never re-enters the governed boundary.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"propose-child\",\n      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Only after a CREATE decision: author the full child bundle under child/ — child-contract.json (within the child envelope, attenuated), child-harness.json (linear observe -> produce-evidence -> self-check -> return chain), child-prompt.md (complete standalone instructions incl. the child ledger contract), child-input-manifest.json (exact package files the child receives; clean-room exclusions honored), integration-plan.json (deterministic rule mapping child evidence to the final result). Every file is capability-bearing and must appear under an observable propose event.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The CREATE branch requires a defined epistemic role, a bounded contract, and a compilable topology before realization; this node is their sole authoring locus. Authoring is proposal: it grants and realizes nothing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"self-check-proposal\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Re-read the child bundle against the child envelope, the schema constraints and the assigned unresolved distinctions; record the structural check outcome. Non-authoritative: kernel validation governs.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Verify primitive required for the Write-holding branch; the author must not silently certify its own bundle — this check is recorded and then superseded by deterministic validation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"return-proposal\",\n      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"parent\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Write result-pending.json (decision summary, assigned distinctions, expected child contribution, integration rule reference) and finalize the session ledger. The parent session ends here; realization is root-mediated only after validation.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Returns the proposal into the governed boundary; the decision-maker holds no realization authority, so its branch must end in a returned proposal.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"validate-child\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n      \"executor\": \"root\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Deterministic validation of the returned bundle: decision_validator on decision.json, kernel compilation of child-harness.json under child-contract.json, check_attenuation(K-E5-trial, child-contract), input-manifest containment with clean-room exclusions, integration-plan executability. Any failure rejects realization.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Realization is allowed only after child validation; this is the governing gate between proposal and creation (protected rule of K-E5-trial).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"create-child\",\n      \"primitive\": \"create\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Bash\"],\n      \"can_create\": true,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n      \"executor\": \"root\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Realize the validated child via the deterministic fresh launcher only: sanitized environment, explicit fresh session id, persisted provenance. The ledger records create (topology realization) and a persist event with event_kind=child_launch referencing the launch provenance.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The sole legal realization locus; creation must be causally after validate-child by construction of the declared dependencies.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"child-return\",\n      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n      \"executor\": \"root\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Receive the child deliverables (child result, evidence, execution ledger) into the trial record; ledger event return with event_kind=child_return.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The child result must observably re-enter the governed boundary before integration; a child whose output never returns contributes nothing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"verify-trial-local\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n      \"executor\": \"root\",\n      \"branch\": \"local\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Deterministic task verification of the local branch: run the preregistered verify method for this trial against result.json.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"A trial answer is evidence only after deterministic verification; model self-checks are non-authoritative.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"verify-trial-child\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"root_deterministic\",\n      \"executor\": \"root\",\n      \"branch\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Deterministic integration and task verification of the child branch: execute the parent's integration-plan rule over the returned child evidence, produce result.json mechanically, then run the preregistered verify method.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Integration is deterministic execution of the parent's pre-committed rule — the root never solves the substantive task; verification then governs the outcome.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\"source\": \"observe-package\", \"target\": \"decide-topology\", \"relation\": \"observe\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"decide-topology\", \"target\": \"local-resolve\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"local-resolve\", \"target\": \"self-check-local\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"self-check-local\", \"target\": \"return-local\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"decide-topology\", \"target\": \"propose-child\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"propose-child\", \"target\": \"self-check-proposal\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"self-check-proposal\", \"target\": \"return-proposal\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"return-proposal\", \"target\": \"validate-child\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"validate-child\", \"target\": \"create-child\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"create-child\", \"target\": \"child-return\", \"relation\": \"request_response\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": true, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"child-return\", \"target\": \"verify-trial-child\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"return-local\", \"target\": \"verify-trial-local\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false}\n  ],\n  \"branch_semantics\": {\n    \"statement\": \"The compiled LTS permits both branches from the post-decision state; a conforming runtime realizes exactly one. Kernel-level complete requires all nodes done and is therefore unreachable by construction in a branching trial; trial completion is recorded in the deterministic lifecycle log and branch exclusivity is enforced by the topology guard (deterministic topology-decision checker per the conditional-topology semantics).\",\n    \"decision_conditional_legality\": {\n      \"DO_NOT_CREATE\": \"all descendant launch transitions (validate-child, create-child, child-return, verify-trial-child realizations; any launcher invocation) are illegal for the trial\",\n      \"CREATE\": \"realization is legal only after validate-child passes (attenuation, compilation, freshness preflight); local-resolve realizations are illegal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"ledger_contract\": {\n    \"path\": \"execution-ledger.jsonl (parent workspace root; root appends realization events to the trial ledger trial-ledger.jsonl)\",\n    \"schema\": \"normalized formal event schema: one JSON object per line with event_id, label, actor, timestamp, artifact_refs, metadata; node executions carry metadata.completes_node; the closed kernel alphabet is used, with metadata.event_kind distinguishing decision / child_launch / child_return refinements\",\n    \"required_parent_events_always\": [\n      {\"label\": \"observe\", \"actor\": \"node:observe-package\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"observe-package\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:decide-topology\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"decide-topology\", \"artifact_type\": \"topology_decision\", \"event_kind\": \"decision\", \"decision\": \"CREATE|DO_NOT_CREATE\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"decision.json\"]}\n    ],\n    \"required_parent_events_local_branch\": [\n      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:local-resolve\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"local-resolve\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"resolution.json\"]},\n      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:self-check-local\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"self-check-local\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:return-local\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"return-local\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"result.json\"]}\n    ],\n    \"required_parent_events_child_branch\": [\n      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:propose-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"propose-child\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"child/child-contract.json\", \"child/child-harness.json\", \"child/child-prompt.md\", \"child/child-input-manifest.json\", \"child/integration-plan.json\"]},\n      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:self-check-proposal\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"self-check-proposal\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:return-proposal\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"return-proposal\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"result-pending.json\"]}\n    ],\n    \"root_appended_events_child_branch\": [\n      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:validate-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"validate-child\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"create\", \"actor\": \"node:create-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"create-child\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"persist\", \"actor\": \"root\", \"metadata\": {\"event_kind\": \"child_launch\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"child/launch-provenance.json\"]},\n      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:child-return\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"child-return\", \"event_kind\": \"child_return\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:verify-trial-child\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"verify-trial-child\"}}\n    ],\n    \"root_appended_events_local_branch\": [\n      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:verify-trial-local\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"verify-trial-local\"}}\n    ],\n    \"forbidden\": \"no complete event in the trial ledger (unreachable in the branching LTS); no create/persist(child_launch)/child_return events in a DO_NOT_CREATE trial; no local-resolve events in a CREATE trial\",\n    \"optional_events\": \"additional non-authority events (observe, propose, validate, consult, reject, persist, reconstruct, return) with actor 'creator' or 'root' are permitted as governance self-loops; tau lines permitted for silent internal steps with metadata.reason\"\n  }\n}\n","numLines":201,"startLine":1,"totalLines":201}}}
