rom the notes, plus the exact string it emits on records.csv, enabling a byte-for-byte comparison the root performs against summary.txt.\",\n      \"why_isolation_matters\": \"The evidential value of the reproduction comes entirely from producer independence; a fresh session that never observed summary.txt cannot copy the target's ordering, casing, or formatting choices, so a match or divergence is genuine evidence rather than an artifact of contamination.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"distinction_id\": \"Q2\",\n      \"expected_evidence\": \"An enumeration of the aspects the notes leave undetermined, derived only from build-notes.md and records.csv, reported alongside the reproduction.\",\n      \"why_isolation_matters\": \"An enumeration produced without sight of the target is not biased toward retrofitting or omitting aspects to match observed bytes, which is the only form of E-A that carries independent evidential weight.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"local_resolution_path\": [],\n  \"expected_information_gain\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"expected_cost\": \"LOW\",\n  \"decision_basis\": [\n    \"E-B is a binding evidence requirement and mandates a clean-room producer with no access to summary.txt; observe-package forced this session to read summary.txt, so the required evidence cannot be generated here at full strength.\",\n    \"summary.txt is a declared clean_room_exclusion, so a fresh child can lawfully receive build-notes.md and records.csv while never seeing the target, exactly satisfying the independence E-B demands.\",\n    \"The cost is one small, terminal, deterministic child; the integration is a mechanical byte comparison the root performs, so expected value clearly exceeds bounded cost.\",\n    \"Local resolution would leave E-B unsatisfiable-at-strength, an unjustified evidential gap, whereas the child closes it without the root ever solving the task.\"\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": 0.82\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1396,"cache_read_input_tokens":45060,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1396},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f77c405f-513f-4318-a03b-7d68642f3399","uuid":"6312aabf-cde2-4161-886b-064d4e3e4bf6","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:05:50.410Z","request_id":"req_011CdsJT9Ch8WvFUmrDGXJnn"}
